			"widgets_values":[
				"0-2s: A close-up tracking shot follows a small child sprinting energetically through a heavy downpour on a vibrant, multi-colored umbrella. The child's face is illuminated by soft, diffused light, showing a determined yet joyful expression as raindrops splash against the umbrella's surface, creating a rhythmic curtain of water. The child's hair and lightweight clothing flutter dynamically with the wind, while their small feet kick up tiny droplets that scatter in the air.\n\n2-4s: The camera smoothly dollies forward, maintaining focus on the child's forward momentum as they navigate the puddles. The colorful umbrella rotates slightly with the child's turns, causing a mesmerizing, slow-motion effect where streams of rainwater cascade off the rim in glistening, rainbow-hued arcs. The background blurs into a bokeh of wet, reflective streetlights and blurred building silhouettes, enhancing the sense of speed and immersion. The interplay of light and water creates a dynamic, almost ethereal atmosphere, with every drop catching the ambient glow.\n\n4-6s: As the child continues to run, the camera pans slightly to the right, revealing more of the surrounding rainy environment. The rain intensity momentarily softens, allowing glimpses of the wet pavement reflecting the sky. The child's breathing becomes visible as a faint mist in the cool air, adding a layer of realism. The sequence concludes with the child pausing briefly under the umbrella, letting the rain roll off the colorful fabric, their face turning toward the camera with a radiant, rain-soaked smile, framed by the gentle, continuous fall of water that never truly stops. The entire scene is bathed in a cinematic, high-contrast palette that emphasizes the vivid colors of the umbrella against the cool, monochromatic tones of the rain."
